From cb01a5222f5a319a85726f08294fefdce8de5e40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matteo Geromin <geromin.matteo@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:11:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/17] configs: am335x_evm: drop SPL Ymodem support to free
 SPL SRAM

SPL was within a few bytes of the 0x1b000 SRAM limit, leaving no room
for the BeagleBone 3D printer pinmux tables. Disable SPL_YMODEM_SUPPORT
(loading U-Boot over UART), which frees about 2.7 KiB.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configs/am335x_evm_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/configs/am335x_evm_defconfig b/configs/am335x_evm_defconfig
index 566bded6d87..e42bb93d9f2 100644
--- a/configs/am335x_evm_defconfig
+++ b/configs/am335x_evm_defconfig
@@ -39,6 +39,7 @@ CONFIG_SPL_FALCON_BOOT_MMCSD=y
 CONFIG_SYS_MMCSD_RAW_MODE_KERNEL_SECTOR=0x1700
 CONFIG_SYS_MMCSD_RAW_MODE_ARGS_SECTOR=0x1500
 CONFIG_SYS_MMCSD_RAW_MODE_ARGS_SECTORS=0x200
+# CONFIG_SPL_YMODEM_SUPPORT is not set
 CONFIG_CMD_EXTENSION=y
 CONFIG_CMD_SPL=y
 CONFIG_CMD_SPL_NAND_OFS=0x00080000
-- 
2.39.5

